# LeakSanitizer suppressions for leaks in vendored dependencies, never in
# clawtilla's own code.  Each entry names the upstream bug; remove it in
# the change that pins the dependency release that fixes it.
#
# podomation 643fe83 (libreclaw v0.29.0), modules/container/
# pod-container-module.c: container_open_stream() and
# container_stream_thread_func() leave the GError from a failed or
# cancelled event-stream read set when the module is stopping.  Fix:
# g_clear_error(&error) before each early return/break.  See roadmap.org,
# "Upstream: podomation container event thread leaks its GError".
leak:container_open_stream
leak:container_stream_thread_func
